e the line  passes through the points $A(2,1,-3)$ and $B(1,6,-4)$ we can find a vector parallel to the line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =⟨1,6,-4⟩-⟨2,1,-3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,5,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨-1,5,-1⟩.$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩ & =⟨1,-4,2⟩\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩ & =-23.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327845 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327846 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327847 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327848 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327849 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1041 "selection" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1104 #edb/ref 17592186327846 13194139535034 true] [17592186327844 1110 #uuid "d05dd2c3-a082-50ce-aad1-f27b3c1cd170" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327845 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩=⟨1,-4,2⟩" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327845 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535034 true] [17592186327845 1111 #uuid "1c44dd24-9762-5b0f-b8c3-c517b9b60ba1" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327846 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩=-23" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327846 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535034 true] [17592186327846 1111 #uuid "36d4f699-5e4c-578c-81de-dd6dc5597532" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327847 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨1,-4,2⟩=-23" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327847 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535034 true] [17592186327847 1111 #uuid "17782156-c5bc-52bc-b35a-443a7c32e894" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327848 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨-1,5,-1⟩=0" 13194139535034 true] [17592186327848 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535034 true] [17592186327848 1111 #uuid "e4f58c9a-fc06-5d06-ba42-d722b09b4